acy/leadership-molly-w.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"card-img-top\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Starting a New Tradition of Support</h2><p>by Molly White, Dyne\u2019s vice president, global head of patient advocacy and engagement</p><p></p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/perspectives/starting-a-new-tradition-of-support\">Read more</a></div></article><article class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\"><img src=\"/sites/default/files/legacy/josh.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"card-img-top\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Playing To Win: Building A Position Of Strength In Biotech</h2><p>by Josh Brumm</p><p></p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://lifescivc.com/2021/07/playing-to-win-building-a-position-of-strength-in-biotech/\">Read more</a></div></article><article class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\"><img src=\"/sites/default/files/legacy/romesh.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"card-img-top\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Toward a brighter future: targeting the genetic basis of rare muscle diseases</h2><p>By Romesh Subramanian, Ph.D.</p><p></p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/perspectives/toward-a-brighter-future-targeting-the-genetic-basis-of-rare-muscle-diseases\">Read more</a></div></article><article class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\"><img src=\"/sites/default/files/legacy/persp-pub-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"card-img-top\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Scaling culture with growth: how to maintain your startup\u2019s \u201cspecial sauce\u201d</h2><p>By Joshua Brumm</p><p></p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://lifescivc.com/2021/04/scaling-culture-with-growth-how-to-maintain-your-startups-special-sauce/\">Read more</a></div></article><article class=\"col-12 col-md-6 card\"><img src=\"/sites/default/files/legacy/persp-pub-3-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"card-img-top\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"card-body\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Preparing to pitch in a virtual world</h2><p>Featurin